X-SERVER-UNDER-BLINK: runs through transport + into device init (2026-05-29, ~30 CI builds, supersedes ALL prior wasm32-ceiling conclusions which were WRONG). The real Alpine Xvfb X server now executes deep under blink. Walls cleared, each with a real fix (all in lanmower/blink@libblink-portabox + webix build-blink.yml X-smoke):
1. ~4GB OOM: was Alpine mesa pulling libLLVM-19.so (153MB) mapped+relocated at load. FIX: 49984B stub libGL.so.1 (310 no-op gl*/glX* syms, webix/containers/libGL-stub.c, built -nostdlib) swapped over mesa libGL + LLVM/gallium unlinked.
2. epoll: emscripten sysroot has no <sys/epoll.h>. FIX: poll()-backed blink/epoll_shim.{c,h} (HAVE_EPOLL_SHIM in syscall.c).
3. display lock link(/tmp/.X99-lock)=EMLINK: FIX: Xvfb -nolock.
4. listener socket() rejected: musl sysconf(_SC_OPEN_MAX) returns -1 when RLIMIT_NOFILE=RLIM_INFINITY -> libxtrans SocketOpen rejects fd via fd>=sysconf check. FIX: blink memorymalloc.c NewSystem sets RLIMIT_NOFILE cur/max=1048576 (finite).
5. AF_UNIX server sockets: emscripten libc has no working bind/listen/accept. FIX: in-process AF_UNIX layer blink/unixsock_shim.{c,h} (socket=pipe fd + wake byte; connect=socketpair, enqueue server end, dup2 client end; accept dequeues; handles Linux abstract addrs @). VfsSocket/Bind/Connect/Listen/Accept/Close/Setsockopt/Getsockopt/Getsockname re-#defined to the shim under __EMSCRIPTEN__ in vfs.h. RESULT: BOTH listeners bind+listen (abstract @ + /tmp/.X11-unix/X99), Xvfb passes MakeAllCOTSServerListeners.
